{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026IGWXqQskte1792638756.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港股走勢反覆。</p><p></p><p>恒指高開63點，之後反覆向好。內銀股支撐大市，工行升百分之2，建行及中行均向好。</p><p></p><p>收租股有追捧，領展及九倉置業升百分之3。油價在半年高位徘徊，中石油及中石化升百分之3至4。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:29:44.733572+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T05:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:08.519295+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:27:17.573234+00:00","content_hash":"67acf77fbbcb8c28395d72bc8d0e2e642cad007ce367b3a6b3cff0e77d35caba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:29:44.733572+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}